comments.body:
@JoeyWu-tech — this is the one bit 44e1fec3 doesn't have: the doc comment above `TestUploadStillUnderwayIsNotCutByHealthPing` still ends with "A body that may still be under way is not watched by that ping." Since 05ed578b the first try **is** watched and **is** cut by the lost ping; the body is then sent again on a connection that is not pinged, and that re-sent try is the one the vendor answers.

Fixed as a comment-only change on `upstream/main` 2cdbe92de:

- Branch: https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/3909-stale-upload-test-comment
- Commit: `1c4aa4e4cb7a3eef01ce93a654f2ecb2529fcdef`

```go
// health check closed a connection that was working. The first try is
// watched and cut by that ping; the body is then sent again on a
// connection that is not pinged, which is the try the vendor answers.
```

`go test ./internal/gateway/ -run 'TestUploadStillUnderwayIsNotCutByHealthPing|TestSlowUplinkSkipsTheLostTry' -count=1` — both PASS; `gofmt -l internal/gateway` empty.

